4. WAP to input a list of numbers and create a new list containing only unique elements.

numbers=[]
unique=[]
n=int(input("enter total numbers: "))

for i in range(n):
    num=int(input("enter number:"))
    numbers.append(num)

    for num in numbers:
        if num not in unique:
            unique.append(num)

            print("Original list:",numbers)
            print("Unique list:",unique)
